    "narrow rear CPU service hatch",
    "case-sized rear CPU shelf on full-extension slides",
    "open PC case bolted directly to CPU shelf",
    "custom 600 mm lockdown/siderail/glass system",
    "adjustable backglass/DMD carrier",
    "reserved SSF/DOF zones",
    "separate touch-safe mains zone",
    "two narrow removable low-voltage electronics carriers",
    "filtered generic bottom intake and fixed upper backbox exhaust",
